{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore Circus</strong>\u00a0Demo is a difficult precision-platformer where you play as <strong>Dik</strong>, a skilled acrobat on a daring quest to rescue his brother from the grasp of the <strong>Devil</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1740500085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Hardcore levels (Castle, Ocean, Hell)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Boss fight with the Knight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global Best Time Leaderboard for those who finish the whole demo</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Momentum physics based movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dismemberment - Dik can loose legs and can still continue to roll and jump, however if you loose your both hands you start over</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't have any weapon, but still can defeat bosses and dodge enemies with control of the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face unique traversal and lethal obstacles like Rotating Gear, Portals, Saws, Cannons, Levers, Spikes, Trampolines, Air and Water Currents, Gargoyles, Sharks, Whales, Elephants and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive gameplay, don't give up, get up and try again until you perfect it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/extras/Gif9.gif?t=1740500085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After his brother <strong>Alex</strong> is abducted into the dark portal, <strong>Dik</strong> must take on the <strong>Hardcore Circus Challenge</strong>\u2014a perilous journey through the fiery depths of Hell to rescue his brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1740500085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face twisted environments and brutal challenges that will push your acrobatic abilities to the limit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1740500085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you conquer the hardcore trials and bring <strong>Alex</strong> back, or will the <strong>Devil</strong>'s game end in tragedy? Time is running out...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/extras/Gif10.gif?t=1740500085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493450?t=1740500085","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493450?t=1740500085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/4971c685636c207102829c5624bf396eddb99de9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740500085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/4971c685636c207102829c5624bf396eddb99de9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740500085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore Circus</strong>\u00a0Demo is a difficult precision-platformer where you play as <strong>Dik</strong>, a skilled acrobat on a daring quest to rescue his brother from the grasp of the <strong>Devil</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/extras/Gif4.gif?t=1740500085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Hardcore levels (Castle, Ocean, Hell)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 Boss fight with the Knight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Global Best Time Leaderboard for those who finish the whole demo</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Momentum physics based movement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dismemberment - Dik can loose legs and can still continue to roll and jump, however if you loose your both hands you start over</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't have any weapon, but still can defeat bosses and dodge enemies with control of the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face unique traversal and lethal obstacles like Rotating Gear, Portals, Saws, Cannons, Levers, Spikes, Trampolines, Air and Water Currents, Gargoyles, Sharks, Whales, Elephants and many more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive gameplay, don't give up, get up and try again until you perfect it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493450/extras/Gif9.gif?t=1740500085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After his brother <strong>Alex</strong> is abducted into the dark portal, <strong>Dik</strong> must take on the <strong>Hardcore Circus Challenge</stron